}
```
**Refining Strategy**: [reconcileContext](file:///c:/Users/artin/Documents/Project-GIGI-Firebase/Project-GIGI/src/services/contextReconciler.ts#20-142) currently takes `renderedMessageIds: string[]`. I should update it to take `renderedMessages: ChatMessage[]` so I have the content to re-index.

